    <main>

        <!-- PAGE INTRODUCTION -->
        <section class="about-hero">
            <p class="eyebrow">GET TO KNOW US</p>

            <h1>
                A little less waste.<br>
                <span>A lot more purpose.</span>
            </h1>

            <p>
                ReThread is built on a simple idea:
                clothes that are no longer needed can
                still have a meaningful purpose.
            </p>
        </section>


        <!-- OUR STORY -->
        <section class="about-story">

            <div class="section-label">
                <span>01</span> / THE IDEA BEHIND RETHREAD
            </div>

            <div class="story-layout">

                <div class="story-heading">
                    <h2>
                        Every piece of clothing
                        has more to give.
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <div class="story-description">
                    <p>
                        We often stop using clothes when
                        they no longer fit our needs,
                        styles or preferences. But that
                        does not mean their usefulness
                        has to end.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        ReThread aims to collect donated
                        clothing and give suitable fabrics
                        another purpose by transforming
                        them into useful everyday products.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        From blankets to pillow covers,
                        we want to turn unused materials
                        into something that can benefit
                        others.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- THE PROBLEM -->
        <section class="about-problem">

            <div class="section-label">
                <span>02</span> / THE PROBLEM
            </div>

            <h2>
                Why does clothing reuse matter?
            </h2>

            <div class="problem-layout">

                <div class="problem-main">
                    <h3>Textile waste is more than just unwanted clothes.</h3>

                    <p>
                        Clothing and fabric are often
                        discarded even when parts of
                        them could still be reused.
                        This contributes to the growing
                        problem of textile waste.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        At the same time, many people
                        and communities could benefit
                        from useful everyday essentials.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="problem-side">
                    <div class="problem-point">
                        <span>01</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3>Reduce waste</h3>
                            <p>
                                Make better use of clothing
                                and fabrics that might
                                otherwise be thrown away.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="problem-point">
                        <span>02</span>
                        <div>
                            <h3>Support others</h3>
                            <p>
                                Turn suitable donated
                                materials into useful
                                products for people in need.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- OUR VISION -->
        <section class="about-vision">

            <div class="section-label">
                <span>03</span> / OUR VISION
            </div>

            <h2>
                A future where fewer things go to waste.
            </h2>

            <p>
                We hope to build a community where people
                see the value in reusing what they already
                have. Through ReThread, we want to encourage
                creativity, responsible consumption and
                kindness towards others.
            </p>

        </section>


        <!-- OUR VALUES -->
        <section class="about-values">

            <div class="section-label">
                <span>04</span> / WHAT WE BELIEVE IN
            </div>

            <h2>The values behind ReThread.</h2>

            <div class="values-grid">

                <div class="value-card">
                    <span>01</span>
                    <h3>Sustainability</h3>
                    <p>
                        Making thoughtful use of
                        resources and reducing
                        unnecessary waste.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="value-card">
                    <span>02</span>
                    <h3>Creativity</h3>
                    <p>
                        Finding new possibilities
                        in materials that are often
                        overlooked.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="value-card">
                    <span>03</span>
                    <h3>Community</h3>
                    <p>
                        Bringing people together
                        through donations, teamwork
                        and shared purpose.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="value-card">
                    <span>04</span>
                    <h3>Compassion</h3>
                    <p>
                        Creating useful products
                        with the aim of supporting
                        people who need them.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->
        <section class="about-closing">

            <p class="eyebrow">THE RETHREAD PROMISE</p>

            <h2>
                Don't let a piece of clothing's
                story end in a wardrobe.
            </h2>

            <p>
                Give it another purpose.
                Give it another chance.
            </p>

            <a href="donate.html" class="button">
                Be Part of ReThread ↗
            </a>

        </section>

    </main>


